        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>i want talk about fear card 'Quarantine' and 'avoid the dahan'</p>\r\n\r\n<p>these text mean 'action'??</p>\r\n\r\n<p>if i use adversary habsburg lv1.(Migratory Herders: After the normal Build Step: In each land matching a Build Card, Gather 1 'Town' from a land not matching a Build Card. (In board/land order.)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>and check i&nbsp;gain fear card 'avoid the dahan' lv2 in invader phase-&nbsp;fear effect. and build card is sand.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;all matching lands are&nbsp;Dahan outnumber Town / City.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>and all lands adjacent sand, each have 1 town. and all sand have 1 explorer and 2 dahan.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>i want to know how it works in invader phase-build.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
